    "_comment_gap_fade_shield_regime_gated": "Shipped 2026-10-15 (v2 rule, tier1 exit-lever validation section 9). A blanket gap_fade_shield_enabled=false is pro-cyclical - it lifts bull return but costs return AND adds drawdown in bear/sideways. This regime-gated form relaxes the ORB/gap-fade shields only in non-downtrends (macro BULL/NEUTRAL and technical regime != BEAR) and stays armed in a downturn. Validated: it dominates the blanket flag on all 5 names x 3 windows, with a clear win on MSFT/QQQ/NVDA; CAT is excluded (max DD 10.2% -> 17.4%, walk-forward OOS P&L down). IWM keeps the blanket flag instead.",
